1218
00:47:24,560 --> 00:47:28,319
resolution is in terms of how well an

1219
00:47:26,560 --> 00:47:31,119
imaging system can distinguish two

1220
00:47:28,319 --> 00:47:33,040
objects that are close together.

1221
00:47:31,119 --> 00:47:35,760
For example, imagine two very small

1222
00:47:33,040 --> 00:47:37,920
bright points like two tiny tumors.

1223
00:47:35,760 --> 00:47:40,240
Mathematically, we describe each of

1224
00:47:37,920 --> 00:47:43,520
