1233
00:47:58,720 --> 00:48:03,839
source.

1234
00:48:01,440 --> 00:48:05,680
Now, suppose we have two points. If they

1235
00:48:03,839 --> 00:48:07,440
are far apart, even though each one is

1236
00:48:05,680 --> 00:48:09,920
