1266
00:49:17,040 --> 00:49:21,760
resolution is through the modulation

1267
00:49:18,720 --> 00:49:23,680
transfer function or MTF.

1268
00:49:21,760 --> 00:49:25,920
Here's the idea. Every image can be

1269
00:49:23,680 --> 00:49:28,720
broken down into sinosoidal components

1270
00:49:25,920 --> 00:49:31,359
using forier analysis. These components

1271
00:49:28,720 --> 00:49:33,839
