1272
00:49:31,359 --> 00:49:35,839
gradual changes or high frequency

1273
00:49:33,839 --> 00:49:39,599
representing fine details like sharp

1274
00:49:35,839 --> 00:49:41,680
edges or thin lines.

1275
00:49:39,599 --> 00:49:43,520
If we feed a sinosoidal pattern into an

1276
00:49:41,680 --> 00:49:45,920
imaging system, the system does not pass

1277
00:49:43,520 --> 00:49:48,000
all frequencies equally well. Low

1278
00:49:45,920 --> 00:49:49,920
frequency components pass through almost

1279
00:49:48,000 --> 00:49:51,440
perfectly. But as the frequency

1280
00:49:49,920 --> 00:49:54,880
increases, the system begins to

1281
00:49:51,440 --> 00:49:57,040
attenuate or weaken those components.

1282
00:49:54,880 --> 00:49:58,800
