1288
00:50:08,640 --> 00:50:12,800
frequency increases, the response

1289
00:50:10,400 --> 00:50:14,559
gradually drops. Eventually, at very

1290
00:50:12,800 --> 00:50:16,480
high frequencies, the response falls to

1291
00:50:14,559 --> 00:50:20,000
zero, meaning the system can no longer

1292
00:50:16,480 --> 00:50:21,839
