1293
00:50:20,000 --> 00:50:24,079
A practical way to think about this is

1294
00:50:21,839 --> 00:50:26,079
with a line pair phantom where black and

1295
00:50:24,079 --> 00:50:27,680
white bars alternate like a test

1296
00:50:26,079 --> 00:50:29,760
pattern.

1297
00:50:27,680 --> 00:50:31,440
At low frequencies, the bars are wide

1298
00:50:29,760 --> 00:50:33,119
and the system can reproduce them

1299
00:50:31,440 --> 00:50:34,960
