01:33:34,080 --> 01:33:38,239
These can be computed using statistical

2407
01:33:36,320 --> 01:33:41,840
methods like gray level co-occurrence

2408
01:33:38,239 --> 01:33:43,520
matrices or runlength matrices.

2409
01:33:41,840 --> 01:33:45,520
After we collect these features, we

2410
01:33:43,520 --> 01:33:47,360
don't stop there.

2411
01:33:45,520 --> 01:33:50,000
The next step is to feed them into a

2412
01:33:47,360 --> 01:33:52,000
prediction model. This model may perform

