2417
01:33:58,320 --> 01:34:01,920
treatment.

2418
01:33:59,920 --> 01:34:04,480
So, radiomics really bridges imaging

2419
01:34:01,920 --> 01:34:06,560
with data science. It takes us beyond

2420
01:34:04,480 --> 01:34:08,960
the visual impression and allows us to

2421
01:34:06,560 --> 01:34:11,040
mine the hidden information in images,

2422
01:34:08,960 --> 01:34:15,080
often leading to insights that are not

2423
01:34:11,040 --> 01:34:15,080
visible to the human eye.

2424
01:34:16,639 --> 01:34:20,400
Up to this point, we have mostly talked

2425
01:34:18,400 --> 01:34:22,560
about linear observers such as the

2426
01:34:20,400 --> 01:34:24,880
hoteling observer and its channelized

2427
01:34:22,560 --> 01:34:27,840
version. But in reality, many problems

2428
01:34:24,880 --> 01:34:29,760
