2444
01:35:00,400 --> 01:35:04,400
This idea is powerful for medical

2445
01:35:02,080 --> 01:35:06,239
imaging tasks.

2446
01:35:04,400 --> 01:35:08,480
Images are complex. Disease and

2447
01:35:06,239 --> 01:35:10,400
non-desease patterns may overlap, and

2448
01:35:08,480 --> 01:35:12,960
linear models are not enough to make

2449
01:35:10,400 --> 01:35:15,440
accurate decisions. Neural networks,

2450
01:35:12,960 --> 01:35:17,679
